              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company), the petitioners contend that ERISA \u00a7502(a)(3)(A) provides a clear basis for an injunction to stop the respondents from disbursing funds contrary to the plan."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1d58406068da091f0795a4fe25a49fc77045ad8be6f794b1c2983fb9ceb8440b",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-1d58406068da-0000-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company), they argue that the language, structure, and purpose of ERISA support enjoining the respondents from disbursing funds they have power to determine."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1d58406068da091f0795a4fe25a49fc77045ad8be6f794b1c2983fb9ceb8440b",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-1d58406068da-0000-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 6,
                "start": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company), they invoke the concept of a constructive trust, as used by lower courts, to enforce reimbursement obligations."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1d58406068da091f0795a4fe25a49fc77045ad8be6f794b1c2983fb9ceb8440b",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-1d58406068da-0000-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 10,
                "start": 10
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners (Great-West Life & Annuity Insurance Company), section\u202f404(a) of ERISA obligates fiduciaries to enforce the terms of the plan, reinforcing their claim."
        }
      ],
